{"3953020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silence of the Truth: Origins", "steam_appid": 3953020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/57020cc105f27a759198feb4644edc9c.poster.avif?t=1784780971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/57020cc105f27a759198feb4644edc9c.webm?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/57020cc105f27a759198feb4644edc9c.mp4?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Some truths were never meant to be buried.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a 19th-century archaeologist and travel to an alternate 1850s Mesopotamia — a world where the great sites of ancient history are still lost, waiting to be found. Every relic holds a secret. Every inscription hides a story no one has read in thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/529c56ea2fe509abaf735c312133e352.poster.avif?t=1784780971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/529c56ea2fe509abaf735c312133e352.webm?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no waypoints here, and no one will tell you the answer. You explore, you dig, you record — and the meaning of what you find is something you have to piece together yourself. Silence of the Truth: Origins is a slow-paced, atmospheric puzzle-adventure built on real archaeological method, not shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/39e8b56661d5ae4058b1136798bc5e09.poster.avif?t=1784780971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/39e8b56661d5ae4058b1136798bc5e09.webm?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/39e8b56661d5ae4058b1136798bc5e09.mp4?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your finds back to your desk. Clean them, compare them, cross-reference symbols and materials against everything you've catalogued so far. A deduction board lets you connect artifacts by hand — string by string — until scattered fragments start forming a single, undeniable picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/9b6adfe34788ec1b0aa02e4ae5a7bfc5.poster.avif?t=1784780971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/9b6adfe34788ec1b0aa02e4ae5a7bfc5.webm?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/9b6adfe34788ec1b0aa02e4ae5a7bfc5.mp4?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every clue is where you'd expect it. Some truths are hidden in plain sight, visible only if you know how to look — literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/0e7332b0d42ab50de170f598d9d4ecd4.poster.avif?t=1784780971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/0e7332b0d42ab50de170f598d9d4ecd4.webm?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/extras/0e7332b0d42ab50de170f598d9d4ecd4.mp4?t=1784780971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies. No combat. Only exploration, deduction, and the quiet weight of history. As you examine tablets, tools, and relics from a lost world, you'll uncover connections that don't just complete your notebook — they rewrite what you thought you knew. Not every discovery can be measured in gold or glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Authentic Archaeological Investigation</strong> — real historical sites reimagined as fully explorable, playable worlds</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition &amp; Discovery</strong> — travel through untamed landscapes, uncover dig sites, and solve hand-crafted environmental puzzles to reach buried ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parallax Shift Cartography</strong> — chart unmapped terrain using the same parallax method period surveyors relied on: shift your position between two points and triangulate the distance between them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Excavation &amp; Preservation</strong> — carefully unearth artifacts, clean and catalog them for transport back to your institute</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Restoration</strong> — piece broken relics back together by hand, recovering details time tried to erase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linguistic Discovery</strong> — decode genuine ancient scripts to uncover lost knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Interpretation</strong> — analyze excavated objects to deduce their origin, cultural period, and purpose — from pottery and tools to masks and ritual relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deduction Board</strong> — physically connect clues, artifacts, and hypotheses to uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research &amp; Reporting</strong> — document findings in your notebook, form hypotheses, and publish academic reports for your institute</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Grounded Mystery</strong> — no monsters, only traces of humanity, brought to life with stunning HDRP visuals in Unity 6</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built solo, by hand — from concept to code to every stone in every ruin. Silence of the Truth: Origins draws on real fieldwork experience from an actual excavation in İzmir, Turkey, and years of research into ancient Mesopotamia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 