hem for transport back to your institute</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Restoration</strong> — piece broken relics back together by hand, recovering details time tried to erase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linguistic Discovery</strong> — decode genuine ancient scripts to uncover lost knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Interpretation</strong> — analyze excavated objects to deduce their origin, cultural period, and purpose — from pottery and tools to masks and ritual relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Deduction Board</strong> — physically connect clues, artifacts, and hypotheses to uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research &amp; Reporting</strong> — document findings in your notebook, form hypotheses, and publish academic reports for your institute</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Grounded Mystery</strong> — no monsters, only traces of humanity, brought to life with stunning HDRP visuals in Unity 6</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built solo, by hand — from concept to code to every stone in every ruin. Silence of the Truth: Origins draws on real fieldwork experience from an actual excavation in İzmir, Turkey, and years of research into ancient Mesopotamia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A realistic archaeological simulation where you explore forgotten sites, solve puzzles, examine ancient relics, and piece together the secrets of history.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953020/efbd1c2fa8db1ea8aec13585cb420a509aaa2238/header.jpg?t=1784780971", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.